SUMMARY:Azure Decoded: Take Control-Policies and Alerts for Microsoft Foun
 dry
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nProactive security starts here. Lea
 rn how to configure policies and alerts that keep your AI workloads safe a
 nd compliant\, giving you full control over your cloud environment.\n\n**W
 hat you’ll learn:**\n---\n\nExplain how guardrails secure model interact
 ions in Microsoft Foundry\n\n* Describe safety controls such as content fi
 lters\, blocklists\, and Prompt Shields\n* Configure and validate custom g
 uardrails for different workload types\n* Evaluate guardrail effectiveness
  and refine configurations for continuous assurance\n\n**Who should attend
 :**\nDevelopers\, Security Engineers\, and technical professionals who wan
 t to discover how to monitor\, detect\, and respond to AI-specific securit
 y threats using Defender for Cloud AI Foundry’s powerful capabilities.\n
 \n📍 https://aka.ms/ProtectMSFTFoundrywithDefender
