SUMMARY:Get Certified: Fabric Analytics Engineer (DP-600 Accelerated)
DESCRIPTION:Microsoft Reactor Toronto\nThis session was so popular\, we ha
 d to do it again. In this one-hour session\, we’ll walk through the key 
 differences between the PL-300 and DP-600 exams\, highlight the new concep
 ts covered in the DP-600 exam\, and share practical tips for studying. You
 ’ll leave with a clear roadmap of what to study and where to focus.\n\n
 📍 This session is a part of a series. [Learn more here](https://develop
 er.microsoft.com/reactor/series/S-1622/?wt.mc_id=meetup_S-1622_webpage_rea
 ctor)
